{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>焦點報道：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>宏福苑大火｜獨立委員會報告重點速讀　宏業、鴻毅是罪魁禍首　ICU執法鬆懈責任較大 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4e5lnfe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4e5lnfe</a> </li>\n<li>宏福苑大火報告・1｜點名宏業、鴻毅是罪魁禍首、唯利是圖　應受最嚴厲批評 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4BzJrkv\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4BzJrkv</a></li>\n<li>宏福苑大火報告・2｜4政府部門須負責　ICU責任較大　若嚴肅履職可減罹難人數 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3W2oZsm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3W2oZsm</a></li>\n<li>宏福苑大火報告・3｜無證據顯示黃碧嬌涉圍標　「招標妥」為防範對象披合法外衣 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zWwHmd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4zWwHmd</a> </li>\n<li>宏福苑大火｜李家超率高官鞠躬道歉　僅何永賢請辭　三局長避答下台問題 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4eo4Bbx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4eo4Bbx</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zUVVkX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4zUVVkX</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4iLLJ8G\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4iLLJ8G</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zWUB12\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4zWUB12</a> </li>\n<li>宏福苑大火報告｜居民觀看記者會　質疑高官道歉欠誠意　一局長下台僅「最低消費」<a href=\"https://bit.ly/3UooGaz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3UooGaz</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4iMhQVM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4iMhQVM</a> </li>\n<li>蔡天鳳案續審｜鄺球庭上改認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪　繼續就謀殺罪受審 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3U1Ty0F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3U1Ty0F</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4svjEWz\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4svjEWz</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4iod5Ai\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4iod5Ai</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yNT7oK\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4yNT7oK</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4f10mma\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4f10mma</a> </li>\n<li>王岸然案續審｜王續自辯稱「踩住紅線條邊嚟行」　不曾煽動違法行為 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3Uk34w1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3Uk34w1</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/47H64WE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/47H64WE</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4iluVDZ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4iluVDZ</a> 、 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3UiIBrD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3UiIBrD</a> </li>\n<li>2019年非法集結及蒙面罪不成立　律政司上訴得直發還原審　被告改認罪判監6個月 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4dYDIe2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4dYDIe2</a> </li>\n<li>食環衞生督察涉拒分六合彩獎金　14名同事入稟追討2891萬元 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/3Wrh9IM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/3Wrh9IM</a> </li>\n<li>李運騰升上訴庭　任職原訟庭近8年　曾審黎智英、初選47人及支聯會國安案 <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4zqK4vd\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://bit.ly/4zqK4vd</a></li>\n</ul>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T04:41:02.207021+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":931,"images":0,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T04:32:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:23.467839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T04:38:03.281654+00:00","content_hash":"a9f637a9292ac4f8b2405c18abb517860f6c60a1c64f53d7212711157bd73d86","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}